// hex_recover — rebuild a model from the field — exactly, or with a reported residual.
//
// The `rebuild` map. Constructive recovery reads the form off the field, enumerating nothing:
// every admitted form is convex, so the convex hull of the filled cells IS the turtle polygon.
// The census that decided injectivity is here too, with the three digests that answer three
// different questions and must never be confused.
//
// Entry point: re-exports `formfit`, `formcensus`.
use formfit;
use formcensus;
